From b0903e73b3ee81eba5120d79103fcb7bc7c6d118 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lotus Developer <dev@lotus.org>
Date: Thu, 16 Apr 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] lotus_v2: implement 3-tier fee hysteresis, exact runtime CU,
 and <k> ENUMERATE bound

Replace single-threshold fee admission with 3-tier congestion hysteresis,
charge exact runtime compute units (CU) during VM execution, and require
an explicit <k> iteration bound on OP_ENUMERATE.
